  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Safety Measures**\n\nI\'m currently fleshing out the \'digital shield\' aspects. I\'m thinking of incorporating a hidden 3-digit access to critical functions alongside the duress PIN. The audio recording feature to Supabase is next in my sights. I plan to refine the shake-to-SOS functionality and consider alternative triggers.\n\n\n**Refining App Security**\n\nI\'m now integrating a photo sanitizer with EXIF data cleaning. I\'m focusing on \"digital lockdown\" shortcuts for instant security. I\'m also exploring atomic read-and-burn notes for added privacy. The security press on logo implementation is planned.\n\n\n**Synchronizing Naming Conventions**\n\nI\'ve just confirmed the string and metadata alignment. Setting both `app_name` and the `name` field to \"Petal\" is the correct solution for both platform consistency and the discreet name requirement. I\'m now cross-referencing this decision with the skill set to ensure no further optimization opportunities are missed. \"Petal\" (The Invisible Guardian / Period & Health Tracker disguise) sounds good.\n\n\n"
