  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing Petal\'s Palette**\n\nI\'m starting the design for \"Petal\'s\" soft, elegant disguise palette. I\'m focusing on \"Color.kt\" and \"Theme.kt\". My current thoughts are centered on implementing Soft Rose, Blush Pink, Sage Green, Deep Slate, and Warm Off-White to create the foundation of the color system. This will be the first step to establish the brand feel.\n\n\n**Defining Security Features**\n\nI\'ve been immersed in defining the security architecture. I\'ve fleshed out `CryptoManager.kt`, nailing down PBKDF2WithHmacSHA256, salt/iteration details, and hash/verify functions. `PinStorage.kt` is mapped out with SharedPreferences, including the crucial methods for saving, verifying, clearing PINs and setting up encryption. Further progress in data persistence and local data structures is on track too. I\'m moving on to sensor and location implementation next.\n\n\n"
