  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Pin Storage**\n\nI\'m currently working on the `PinStorage.kt` class. My focus is on securely storing both the regular PIN and the duress PIN, including their salts and hashes. I\'ve outlined the necessary methods: `isSetupComplete()` and `savePins()`, which will handle 4-digit verification and ensure the pins are distinct. I am planning on adding error handling.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_418077"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"package com.example.core.security\\n\\nimport android.content.Context\\nimport android.content.SharedPreferences\\n\\nsealed class PinVerificationResult {\\n  data object NormalPinSuccess : PinVerificationResult()\\n  data object DuressPinSuccess : PinVerificationResult()\\n  data object InvalidPin : PinVerificationResult()\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * Manages persisted PIN hashes and provides distinct verification channels\\n * for Normal and Duress credentials.\\n */\\nclass PinStorage(context: Context) {\\n  private val prefs: SharedPreferences =\\n    context.getSharedPreferences(PREFS_NAME, Context.MODE_PRIVATE)\\n\\n  companion object {\\n    private const val PREFS_NAME = \\\"cloak_secure_pin_store\\\"\\n    private const val KEY_NORMAL_SALT = \\\"normal_pin_salt\\\"\\n    private const val KEY_NORMAL_HASH = \\\"normal_pin_hash\\\"\\n    private const val KEY_DURESS_SALT = \\\"duress_pin_salt\\\"\\n    private const val KEY_DURESS_HASH = \\\"duress_pin_hash\\\"\\n    private const val KEY_IS_SETUP_DONE = \\\"is_pin_setup_completed\\\"\\n  }\\n\\n  fun isSetupComplete(): Boolean {\\n    return prefs.getBoolean(KEY_IS_SETUP_DONE, false) &&\\n      !prefs.getString(KEY_NORMAL_HASH, null).isNullOrBlank() &&\\n      !prefs.getString(KEY_DURESS_HASH, null).isNullOrBlank()\\n  }\\n\\n  /**\\n   * Sets up both PINs atomically.\\n   * Requires:\\n   * - Both PINs must be exactly 4 numeric digits.\\n   * - Normal PIN and Duress PIN must NOT be identical.\\n   */\\n  fun setupPins(normalPin: String, duressPin: String): Result<Unit> {\\n    if (normalPin.length != 4 || !normalPin.all { it.isDigit() }) {\\n      return Result.failure(IllegalArgumentException(\\\"Normal PIN must be exactly 4 digits.\\\"))\\n    }\\n    if (duressPin.length != 4 || !duressPin.all { it.isDigit() }) {\\n      return Result.failure(IllegalArgumentException(\\\"Duress PIN must be exactly 4 digits.\\\"))\\n    }\\n    if (normalPin == duressPin) {\\n      return Result.failure(IllegalArgumentException(\\\"Normal PIN and Duress PIN cannot be identical.\\\"))\\n    }\\n\\n    val normalHashed = CryptoManager.hashPin(normalPin)\\n    val duressHashed = CryptoManager.hashPin(duressPin)\\n\\n    prefs.edit()\\n      .putString(KEY_NORMAL_SALT, normalHashed.saltHex)\\n      .putString(KEY_NORMAL_HASH, normalHashed.hashHex)\\n      .putString(KEY_DURESS_SALT, duressHashed.saltHex)\\n      .putString(KEY_DURESS_HASH, duressHashed.hashHex)\\n      .putBoolean(KEY_IS_SETUP_DONE, true)\\n      .apply()\\n\\n    return Result.success(Unit)\\n  }\\n\\n  fun verify(pin: String): PinVerificationResult {\\n    if (pin.length != 4) return PinVerificationResult.InvalidPin\\n\\n    val normalSalt = prefs.getString(KEY_NORMAL_SALT, \\\"\\\") ?: \\\"\\\"\\n    val normalHash = prefs.getString(KEY_NORMAL_HASH, \\\"\\\") ?: \\\"\\\"\\n    if (CryptoManager.verifyPin(pin, normalSalt, normalHash)) {\\n      return PinVerificationResult.NormalPinSuccess\\n    }\\n\\n    val duressSalt = prefs.getString(KEY_DURESS_SALT, \\\"\\\") ?: \\\"\\\"\\n    val duressHash = prefs.getString(KEY_DURESS_HASH, \\\"\\\") ?: \\\"\\\"\\n    if (CryptoManager.verifyPin(pin, duressSalt, duressHash)) {\\n      return PinVerificationResult.DuressPinSuccess\\n    }\\n\\n    return PinVerificationResult.InvalidPin\\n  }\\n\\n  fun clearAll() {\\n    prefs.edit().clear().apply()\\n  }\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Implement PinStorage with validation, hashing, and verification\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/java/com/example/core/security/PinStorage.kt\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing PinStorage\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create PinStorage.kt\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\343\004\n\340\004\001i\024}\023\363tI\274\353\2075Vb\202\331p\227{\206\344g\243\371P\363!mzs\304\030\342o\352\236\316\025\315L\256\312Mm\343\211\r\323\335F\022t\307|i\212*\215\270+\226\235\244e\216\276(;\374\241\360\310\272X\3211\215\2412\306B\247\213h\325\217F\001\005\243W\367\365\a\306\241LF\225\242\n\325\364~\337I\305\024\214T\t\310M\021j\237\277?\262G\325\377\226\351\'1\275\006\030\370\234_\2711b\020\035f\337\"% \v\261\211\373\nD\235\031\225\370\221\244j\316L\a`\303\250\277\2412\261\214^w\326\301\305\004\212\020o\350\2269\235\201\312\267\372\245\001~\032\004\242\312\031\2638`\245\017#st\377\233\306\017\a\256$:\311E\004\202614\377\201\344D\032\023^m6\214\026\252\371l\365\236?\340\323\005\276\361\351\321J\212\345W>\217\255\367\373\245)HM|\357\277\004d}\266\307*\262v\300D3\036\373F\301\361\373\351\322Q66\341\363N\352Y\t\246\261\276\206\303D\375M\200\201\233\275\332\355r\354\005o\211(\022\n\374NJY\006c\277\nxl\000t\366\003\326\325\255]\302\237L\265D\313\t\223\315\005\016\033#\207\313\024\355i\342\023\227\266\262j\306\002\b\315\315\330\363?\346Rz\255\363\337\357}f\366\2158N\267&\372\306\255\336\222\353\344r\\\346M\212\363\252\324\255Sa\002\243u\317f\266o=\211\324d\203\241:X\330\003\242\250\264\003\201`5K\226m\213\023\223\373\361\275\361\343\307\342\216\227]c\345\370\233u\262A\005\233\355p/R\233Y\347\3339\212\005\315e\212A\261B\251\333F\\\320\336\257p\'\335\372)h\226\3034A\231\3716\237\025-\003\n\226u\360v\205\026\377\207\310\227\036n\20590D\366\023\005L\374\312\032\\a\374\236\315\312\321\006d[M\n\320\225\310\303\256y}\265E\001=\320p\037pK\363\362\207\026i\337\032n\025\036l\207\336X^$r\016b\324\245\364V\343\272i\371g\001j>\310\325bv\355|}\341r\306\261\274@\200\315l\fG\236\361\244\342\265\216\230X8\241\2130~\005-\203jf\233k_^\204\247\264\026\227U\000\333"
