    thinking: "**Constructing Data Structures**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the Room database for Support Circle and Emergency Contacts. This involves creating the `EmergencyContact.kt` entity, the `ContactDao.kt` Data Access Object, and the `CloakDatabase.kt` database itself, as well as the repository class. I\'ll need to define the schema and the necessary interactions between these components.\n\n\n"
