  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Location Provider**\n\nI\'m now focused on the LocationProvider\'s construction. I\'m structuring it to wrap the `FusedLocationProviderClient`. The immediate priority is acquiring the last known location. If permission is granted and a location is readily available, I\'ll then move to requesting a new, high-accuracy fix. Finally, I\'ll integrate it with Google Maps.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
