  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Supabase Modules**\n\nI\'m currently focused on building out the Supabase networking and audio recording modules. I\'ve begun defining the `SupabaseConfig.kt` file, which will handle the URL and public anon key configuration, pulling from either the `BuildConfig` or project defaults. Next up is constructing the `SupabaseClient.kt` file; I\'m making progress here.\n\n\n**Defining Data Upload Logic**\n\nI\'ve been solidifying the data upload process. I\'m building out `SupabaseSosRepository.kt` which will handle posts to `sos_sessions` and `sos_locations` tables, and the file upload to Supabase Storage. I\'m implementing a bounded retry mechanism with exponential backoff for resilience. I\'m also planning on implementing HTTP client with appropriate headers.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_463880"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Append\":false, \"CodeContent\":\"package com.example.data.network\\n\\nimport android.content.Context\\nimport android.content.SharedPreferences\\n\\nobject SupabaseConfig {\\n  // Public/anon credentials configured for Cloak project\\n  // Can be overridden via local settings or environment variables\\n  const val DEFAULT_SUPABASE_URL = \\\"https://your-project.supabase.co\\\"\\n  const val DEFAULT_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY = \\\"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.your-anon-key\\\"\\n\\n  private const val PREFS_NAME = \\\"supabase_config_prefs\\\"\\n  private const val KEY_URL = \\\"supabase_url\\\"\\n  private const val KEY_KEY = \\\"supabase_anon_key\\\"\\n\\n  fun getSupabaseUrl(context: Context): String {\\n    val prefs = context.getSharedPreferences(PREFS_NAME, Context.MODE_PRIVATE)\\n    return prefs.getString(KEY_URL, DEFAULT_SUPABASE_URL) ?: DEFAULT_SUPABASE_URL\\n  }\\n\\n  fun getSupabaseAnonKey(context: Context): String {\\n    val prefs = context.getSharedPreferences(PREFS_NAME, Context.MODE_PRIVATE)\\n    return prefs.getString(KEY_KEY, DEFAULT_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY) ?: DEFAULT_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY\\n  }\\n\\n  fun setCredentials(context: Context, url: String, anonKey: String) {\\n    context.getSharedPreferences(PREFS_NAME, Context.MODE_PRIVATE)\\n      .edit()\\n      .putString(KEY_URL, url.trim().removeSuffix(\\\"/\\\"))\\n      .putString(KEY_KEY, anonKey.trim())\\n      .apply()\\n  }\\n}\\n\", \"Description\":\"Create SupabaseConfig for secure public/anon key storage\", \"Overwrite\":true, \"TargetFile\":\"/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/network/SupabaseConfig.kt\", \"toolAction\":\"Writing SupabaseConfig\", \"toolSummary\":\"Create SupabaseConfig.kt\"}"
