    thinking: "**Refining SosController.kt**\n\nI\'m currently working on enhancing `SosController.kt`. My latest thought involves making it more flexible. I\'m adding optional context and service hooks to control `SosForegroundService` startup and shutdown. Simultaneously, I\'m refactoring it to log session and location data with `SupabaseSosRepository`. Furthermore, I\'m looking at how I can expose certain features.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
