  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering UI Implementation**\n\nI\'m currently focused on incorporating the Petal logo within the `CenterAlignedTopAppBar` composable. My current approach involves wrapping the title or navigation icon row, using `Modifier.secretShieldHold` to conditionally display the logo based on `isSosActive`. I\'m also adding state management via a `showShield` variable to control the visibility of a shield element.\n\n\n**Implementing Shield Feature**\n\nI\'ve integrated the `ShieldDashboardScreen` using a `showShield` state variable to manage its visibility, triggered by the `secretShieldHold` modifier within the navigation icon. The navigation icon now renders a heart icon which can trigger the shield. The title component of the `CenterAlignedTopAppBar` is the simple Petal text. I\'ve imported `secretShieldHold` and `ShieldDashboardScreen`.\n\n\n"
