  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adding State Fields**\n\nI\'m currently updating `SosState.kt`. I\'m adding `ContactSmsStatus` and related fields to `SosState.Active`. This includes `contactStatuses: List<ContactSmsStatus> = emptyList()`, `locationTimestampMs: Long? = null`, and `audioRecordingStatus`. I\'m focused on the SMS and audio aspects of the SOS feature\'s active state.\n\n\n**Defining New Fields**\n\nI\'ve been defining new string fields for statuses related to audio recording and chunk uploading, such as \"Starting recording\", \"Uploading,\" and \"Failed.\" Also, I\'ve added boolean fields to track permission statuses. I also need to make sure to create the `ContactSmsStatus` data class, as well.\n\n\n"
